    {
      "id": "A1-10-L2",
      "position": 2,
      "skill": "grammar",
      "title": "قاعدة: What time is it? / at + time",
      "est_minutes": 15,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "audio",
          "text_en": "What time is it? It is two o'clock. It is half past three. School is at seven o'clock. The bus is at half past seven."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "لنسأل عن الساعة نقول: **What time is it?** ونجيب بـ **It is** + الوقت:\n\n- **It is seven o'clock.** = الساعة السابعة تماماً.\n- **It is half past seven.** = السابعة والنصف.\n\nلنقول **موعد** حدث ما نستخدم حرف الجر **at** قبل الساعة:\n- School starts **at** seven o'clock.\n- The bus is **at** half past seven.\n\nومع أجزاء اليوم نستخدم **in**: **in** the morning, **in** the afternoon, **in** the evening. أما الليل فنقول **at** night.\n\n**الخطأ الشائع:** أن نقول «in seven o'clock». الصحيح: **at** seven o'clock."
        },
